[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6120.709, "timestamp": "01:42:00", "text": "最近"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6125.229, "timestamp": "01:42:05", "text": "我姐姐用铃铛。为了实现你的愿望，铃铛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6130.39, "timestamp": "01:42:10", "text": "通过权力借用自身未来的潜力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6131.91, "timestamp": "01:42:11", "text": "姐姐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6135.47, "timestamp": "01:42:15", "text": "请以巫女的身份，认清钟声。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6138.91, "timestamp": "01:42:18", "text": "我将接管。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6144.03, "timestamp": "01:42:24", "text": "完全没问题。更重要的是，Chandou"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6147.51, "timestamp": "01:42:27", "text": "你总是会想这类事情吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6154.79, "timestamp": "01:42:34", "text": "做梦是好事，但对你来说还太早了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6155.04, "timestamp": "01:42:35", "text": "。 与其谈论铃铛之类的东西，不如和姐姐在樱花树下练习射箭，这样岂不是很无聊吗？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6171.51, "timestamp": "01:42:51", "text": "哦，你真的不想吃吗？"}]